    "updated_at": "2016-11-23T07:47:07Z",
    "body": "Anything that moves the needle closer to getting this implemented would be better than trying to get it perfect and then be too difficult to implement. If the easiest thing would be to just return a list of all focusable and tabable elements not in tab order, I'd be ok with that.\r\n\r\nI'm not sure what you mean by that last part. ",
