    "created_at": "2016-11-29T22:06:10Z",
    "updated_at": "2016-11-29T22:06:10Z",
    "body": "> The primary use case was for auto-focusing the first focusable element in the dialog.\r\n\r\nJust curious if the `autofocus` attribute could be used for this? Maybe if something gets added to the top layer (#897) it looks for and attempts to focus any child with `autofocus`?",
