    "updated_at": "2017-04-18T17:51:25Z",
    "body": "With #1929 changing the modal requirement to focus the dialog instead of the first focusable element (or using `autofocus` to manually focus an element), and #897 taking care of trapping tab focus, I believe this issues primary use cases have been resolved. I'm going to close this issue, thanks for the great discussions.",
